# Generated experiment run output under docs/notes.
# Convention: one experiment run per "<name>-YYYY-MM-DD/" directory. Machine-written
# run artifacts (plans, receipts, embeddings, generated viewers) are local-only and
# reproducible; do not add per-experiment paths here when a new run starts.
# Authored Markdown reports, reviewed CSVs and tooling fixtures stay in Git.
/docs/notes/**/*-????-??-??/**
!/docs/notes/**/*-????-??-??/**/
!/docs/notes/**/*-????-??-??/**/*.md
!/docs/notes/**/*-????-??-??/**/*.csv
!/docs/notes/**/*-????-??-??/**/*.ts

# Throwaway local review tooling and its browser profile.
ui/tools/.layout-harness/
